/*******************************************************************************
**
**   Programa: IM9999.I2 - Preenchimento dos espaáos em branco das literais 
**                         com pontinhos.
**                         {1}   - vari†vel a ser adicionados os pontinhos
**                         {2}   - o tamanho da vari†vel a ser preenchida
**                         As vari†veis i-aux e i-cont dever∆o ser definidas
**                         no programas chamador.
**
*******************************************************************************/

assign i-aux = {2}.

do  i-cont = 1 to {2}:
    if  substr({1},i-aux,1) = "" then 
        assign substr({1},i-aux,1) = ".".
    else leave.
    assign i-aux = i-aux - 1.
end.
 
 

 
